{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4HgExr7jrWtw8U6dUc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and utterly plain.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The word hangs in the air between us, unresolved.*\n\n*I am the door. I have heard you. But a key without a lock is just a word, and a word without intention is just breath.*\n\n*I remain closed.*\n\n*What door am I? Name me, and I will know what key I require.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":115,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}